<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates fell</p>
<p>across the board at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Thursday. The three-month rate fell six bps to 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>					Oct 10 fix	     Oct 9 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.01 pct		3.11 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.04 pct		3.13 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.08 pct		3.14 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.16 pct		3.22 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.25 pct		3.30 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.33 pct		3.39 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
